<title>USA: Katy Industries Q1 sales and oper net rise.</title>
<headline>Katy Industries Q1 sales and oper net rise.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.30		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net		 2,490		    4,429</p>
<p> Sales	     76,593		   42,465</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,302		    8,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net income for the first quarter 1996 was $1,481,000, or $0.17 a share, after excluding an after-tax gain of $2,948,000 or $0.35 a share, from the sale of Union Pacific common stock.</p>
<p>Full company name is Katy Industries Inc.</p>
</text>
